%YAML 1.1
%TAG !u! tag:unity3d.com,2011:
--- !u!114 &11400000
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 6626c84bb700413428bce8fec5aff79d, type: 3}
  m_Name: BeSubtle
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  _sameOptionTarget: 0
  _lines:
  - _speaker: 0
    _charSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 5d5bfc11db4b6324d85fdd72f11891ad, type: 3}
    _CG: {fileID: 0}
    _music: {fileID: 0}
    _shakeCamera: 0
    _triggerHeartbeat: 0
    _maxFriendship: 0
    _dialogueLine: Jessi...
  - _speaker: 0
    _charSprite: {fileID: 0}
    _CG: {fileID: 0}
    _music: {fileID: 0}
    _shakeCamera: 0
    _triggerHeartbeat: 0
    _maxFriendship: 0
    _dialogueLine: Is there something that you've been grappling with that you haven't
      told me?
  - _speaker: 1
    _charSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 051809b70c0d48749b41aef782cb1ee0, type: 3}
    _CG: {fileID: 0}
    _music: {fileID: 0}
    _shakeCamera: 0
    _triggerHeartbeat: 0
    _maxFriendship: 0
    _dialogueLine: Huh?
  - _speaker: 0
    _charSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: a7221be3902993e49920b17cf290b8cb, type: 3}
    _CG: {fileID: 0}
    _music: {fileID: 0}
    _shakeCamera: 0
    _triggerHeartbeat: 0
    _maxFriendship: 0
    _dialogueLine: Well, I say this as an observer, but I believe that there's something
      deeper that's been troubling you.
  - _speaker: 0
    _charSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 5d5bfc11db4b6324d85fdd72f11891ad, type: 3}
    _CG: {fileID: 0}
    _music: {fileID: 0}
    _shakeCamera: 0
    _triggerHeartbeat: 0
    _maxFriendship: 0
    _dialogueLine: If that turns out to be true, I'd rather you tell me so we can
      clear the air.
  - _speaker: 1
    _charSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: f029f114187d16c46b68146e4a2ca0fb, type: 3}
    _CG: {fileID: 0}
    _music: {fileID: 0}
    _shakeCamera: 0
    _triggerHeartbeat: 0
    _maxFriendship: 0
    _dialogueLine: ...you'll just make fun of me.
  - _speaker: 1
    _charSprite: {fileID: 0}
    _CG: {fileID: 0}
    _music: {fileID: 0}
    _shakeCamera: 0
    _triggerHeartbeat: 0
    _maxFriendship: 0
    _dialogueLine: You'll say I'm pathetic and stupid or whatever and then I'll regret
      ever telling you.
  - _speaker: 0
    _charSprite: {fileID: 0}
    _CG: {fileID: 0}
    _music: {fileID: 0}
    _shakeCamera: 0
    _triggerHeartbeat: 0
    _maxFriendship: 0
    _dialogueLine: Jessi.
  - _speaker: 0
    _charSprite: {fileID: 0}
    _CG: {fileID: 0}
    _music: {fileID: 0}
    _shakeCamera: 0
    _triggerHeartbeat: 0
    _maxFriendship: 0
    _dialogueLine: I promise you that there's nothing you can say now that will make
      me think any lesser of you.
  - _speaker: 0
    _charSprite: {fileID: 0}
    _CG: {fileID: 0}
    _music: {fileID: 0}
    _shakeCamera: 0
    _triggerHeartbeat: 0
    _maxFriendship: 0
    _dialogueLine: In fact, whatever you tell me will further inform my opinion of
      you. Isn't that a good thing?
  - _speaker: 1
    _charSprite: {fileID: 0}
    _CG: {fileID: 0}
    _music: {fileID: 0}
    _shakeCamera: 0
    _triggerHeartbeat: 0
    _maxFriendship: 0
    _dialogueLine: ...
  - _speaker: 0
    _charSprite: {fileID: 0}
    _CG: {fileID: 0}
    _music: {fileID: 0}
    _shakeCamera: 0
    _triggerHeartbeat: 0
    _maxFriendship: 0
    _dialogueLine: I want to learn more about you, Jessi.
  - _speaker: 0
    _charSprite: {fileID: 0}
    _CG: {fileID: 0}
    _music: {fileID: 0}
    _shakeCamera: 0
    _triggerHeartbeat: 0
    _maxFriendship: 0
    _dialogueLine: Tell me everything.
  - _speaker: 1
    _charSprite: {fileID: 0}
    _CG: {fileID: 0}
    _music: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 0c5382dc1be826a4581be7153a44fbd4, type: 3}
    _shakeCamera: 0
    _triggerHeartbeat: 0
    _maxFriendship: 0
    _dialogueLine: ...
  - _speaker: 1
    _charSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 8fadb01c20afe834da1f4899841afc76, type: 3}
    _CG: {fileID: 0}
    _music: {fileID: 0}
    _shakeCamera: 0
    _triggerHeartbeat: 0
    _maxFriendship: 0
    _dialogueLine: ...Sigh, fine.
  - _speaker: 1
    _charSprite: {fileID: 0}
    _CG: {fileID: 0}
    _music: {fileID: 0}
    _shakeCamera: 0
    _triggerHeartbeat: 0
    _maxFriendship: 0
    _dialogueLine: If you want to know that bad, I'll tell you.
  - _speaker: 1
    _charSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: f029f114187d16c46b68146e4a2ca0fb, type: 3}
    _CG: {fileID: 0}
    _music: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 82b2b2dc0a64dd341b5a23d5da1f7232, type: 3}
    _shakeCamera: 0
    _triggerHeartbeat: 0
    _maxFriendship: 0
    _dialogueLine: 'I had a brother, right? Keyword: had.'
  - _speaker: 1
    _charSprite: {fileID: 0}
    _CG: {fileID: 0}
    _music: {fileID: 0}
    _shakeCamera: 0
    _triggerHeartbeat: 0
    _maxFriendship: 0
    _dialogueLine: I guess he was just wandering around like an idiot and got himself
      kidnapped one day. At least that's what I heard.
  - _speaker: 1
    _charSprite: {fileID: 0}
    _CG: {fileID: 0}
    _music: {fileID: 0}
    _shakeCamera: 0
    _triggerHeartbeat: 0
    _maxFriendship: 0
    _dialogueLine: I remember that day when I became an only child, my parents were
      freaking the fuck out over losing one of their kids.
  - _speaker: 1
    _charSprite: {fileID: 0}
    _CG: {fileID: 0}
    _music: {fileID: 0}
    _shakeCamera: 0
    _triggerHeartbeat: 0
    _maxFriendship: 0
    _dialogueLine: They kept trying to come up with shit to make sure I'd stay safe
      and that they wouldn't lose me.
  - _speaker: 1
    _charSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 264ba0fd55f3f0d40aa0a3d014011923, type: 3}
    _CG: {fileID: 0}
    _music: {fileID: 0}
    _shakeCamera: 0
    _triggerHeartbeat: 0
    _maxFriendship: 0
    _dialogueLine: Wanna know what their brightest idea was?
  - _speaker: 1
    _charSprite: {fileID: 0}
    _CG: {fileID: 0}
    _music: {fileID: 0}
    _shakeCamera: 0
    _triggerHeartbeat: 0
    _maxFriendship: 0
    _dialogueLine: To keep me locked up in my room forever.
  - _speaker: 1
    _charSprite: {fileID: 0}
    _CG: {fileID: 0}
    _music: {fileID: 0}
    _shakeCamera: 0
    _triggerHeartbeat: 0
    _maxFriendship: 0
    _dialogueLine: The emptiest room in the world.
  - _speaker: 1
    _charSprite: {fileID: 0}
    _CG: {fileID: 0}
    _music: {fileID: 0}
    _shakeCamera: 0
    _triggerHeartbeat: 0
    _maxFriendship: 0
    _dialogueLine: No windows because the glass could break and hurt me;
  - _speaker: 1
    _charSprite: {fileID: 0}
    _CG: {fileID: 0}
    _music: {fileID: 0}
    _shakeCamera: 0
    _triggerHeartbeat: 0
    _maxFriendship: 0
    _dialogueLine: no blankets because I could suffocate myself while they weren't
      looking;
  - _speaker: 1
    _charSprite: {fileID: 0}
    _CG: {fileID: 0}
    _music: {fileID: 0}
    _shakeCamera: 0
    _triggerHeartbeat: 0
    _maxFriendship: 0
    _dialogueLine: no decor on the walls because it could fall off and kill me.
  - _speaker: 1
    _charSprite: {fileID: 0}
    _CG: {fileID: 0}
    _music: {fileID: 0}
    _shakeCamera: 0
    _triggerHeartbeat: 0
    _maxFriendship: 0
    _dialogueLine: 'And the most important thing: no outside contact.'
  - _speaker: 1
    _charSprite: {fileID: 0}
    _CG: {fileID: 0}
    _music: {fileID: 0}
    _shakeCamera: 0
    _triggerHeartbeat: 0
    _maxFriendship: 0
    _dialogueLine: I was basically the safest kid to ever exist. I would basically
      just live forever without having to ever deal with the dangers of whatever
      the world could do to me.
  - _speaker: 1
    _charSprite: {fileID: 0}
    _CG: {fileID: 0}
    _music: {fileID: 0}
    _shakeCamera: 0
    _triggerHeartbeat: 0
    _maxFriendship: 0
    _dialogueLine: But it was so. Fucking. Boring.
  - _speaker: 1
    _charSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: f029f114187d16c46b68146e4a2ca0fb, type: 3}
    _CG: {fileID: 0}
    _music: {fileID: 0}
    _shakeCamera: 0
    _triggerHeartbeat: 0
    _maxFriendship: 0
    _dialogueLine: So mind-numbingly boring. So so so so so so so boring. So boring
      that I would go to bed hoping I wouldn't wake up. That the ceiling I stared
      at endlessly would just fall and crush me under its weight.
  - _speaker: 1
    _charSprite: {fileID: 0}
    _CG: {fileID: 0}
    _music: {fileID: 0}
    _shakeCamera: 0
    _triggerHeartbeat: 0
    _maxFriendship: 0
    _dialogueLine: I looked forward to death more than I ever looked forward to life.
      If you can even call what I went through "living."
  - _speaker: 1
    _charSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 264ba0fd55f3f0d40aa0a3d014011923, type: 3}
    _CG: {fileID: 0}
    _music: {fileID: 0}
    _shakeCamera: 0
    _triggerHeartbeat: 0
    _maxFriendship: 0
    _dialogueLine: "Shit was like that up until I turned like\u2026 17? 18? It's
      hard to keep track of the days when every day is just the same."
  - _speaker: 1
    _charSprite: {fileID: 0}
    _CG: {fileID: 0}
    _music: {fileID: 0}
    _shakeCamera: 0
    _triggerHeartbeat: 0
    _maxFriendship: 0
    _dialogueLine: I guess my parents were starting to lose their grip with age.
      I could taste it in the stale meals they gave me; somehow they got even staler
      with time.
  - _speaker: 1
    _charSprite: {fileID: 0}
    _CG: {fileID: 0}
    _music: {fileID: 0}
    _shakeCamera: 0
    _triggerHeartbeat: 0
    _maxFriendship: 0
    _dialogueLine: They were losing their edge and getting worse at making my daily
      life completely miserable.
  - _speaker: 1
    _charSprite: {fileID: 0}
    _CG: {fileID: 0}
    _music: {fileID: 0}
    _shakeCamera: 0
    _triggerHeartbeat: 0
    _maxFriendship: 0
    _dialogueLine: But that came with the best day of my life. The day they forgot
      to lock my door.
  - _speaker: 1
    _charSprite: {fileID: 0}
    _CG: {fileID: 0}
    _music: {fileID: 0}
    _shakeCamera: 0
    _triggerHeartbeat: 0
    _maxFriendship: 0
    _dialogueLine: I couldn't even believe it at first, if I'm being real with you.
      It felt like I was having a dream for the first time in my life.
  - _speaker: 1
    _charSprite: {fileID: 0}
    _CG: {fileID: 0}
    _music: {fileID: 0}
    _shakeCamera: 0
    _triggerHeartbeat: 0
    _maxFriendship: 0
    _dialogueLine: I flung my door open and the rest of the house just flashbanged
      me. I hadn't seen anything outside my room since I was, what, five??
  - _speaker: 1
    _charSprite: {fileID: 0}
    _CG: {fileID: 0}
    _music: {fileID: 0}
    _shakeCamera: 0
    _triggerHeartbeat: 0
    _maxFriendship: 0
    _dialogueLine: It was absolutely quiet. My parents weren't home that day.
  - _speaker: 1
    _charSprite: {fileID: 0}
    _CG: {fileID: 0}
    _music: {fileID: 0}
    _shakeCamera: 0
    _triggerHeartbeat: 0
    _maxFriendship: 0
    _dialogueLine: Honestly felt like I was an intruder robbing my own house.
  - _speaker: 1
    _charSprite: {fileID: 0}
    _CG: {fileID: 0}
    _music: {fileID: 0}
    _shakeCamera: 0
    _triggerHeartbeat: 0
    _maxFriendship: 0
    _dialogueLine: So I guess I decided to play into that a bit.
  - _speaker: 1
    _charSprite: {fileID: 0}
    _CG: {fileID: 0}
    _music: {fileID: 0}
    _shakeCamera: 0
    _triggerHeartbeat: 0
    _maxFriendship: 0
    _dialogueLine: I basically searched every edge of the house for as much money,
      food, and water that I could bring with me to get out of that damn place.
  - _speaker: 1
    _charSprite: {fileID: 0}
    _CG: {fileID: 0}
    _music: {fileID: 0}
    _shakeCamera: 0
    _triggerHeartbeat: 0
    _maxFriendship: 0
    _dialogueLine: I came out with a lot more than I was expecting; damn hoarders
      keeping way too much fucking stuff.
  - _speaker: 1
    _charSprite: {fileID: 0}
    _CG: {fileID: 0}
    _music: {fileID: 0}
    _shakeCamera: 0
    _triggerHeartbeat: 0
    _maxFriendship: 0
    _dialogueLine: After I got what I thought was enough, I just got the fuck out
      of there as fast as I could.
  - _speaker: 1
    _charSprite: {fileID: 0}
    _CG: {fileID: 0}
    _music: {fileID: 0}
    _shakeCamera: 0
    _triggerHeartbeat: 0
    _maxFriendship: 0
    _dialogueLine: It felt weird to have the wind blow in my face for the first time
      in years, but it wasn't something that I hated.
  - _speaker: 1
    _charSprite: {fileID: 0}
    _CG: {fileID: 0}
    _music: {fileID: 0}
    _shakeCamera: 0
    _triggerHeartbeat: 0
    _maxFriendship: 0
    _dialogueLine: My legs hurt so bad trying to run because I had barely ever done
      that in my whole life, but I just sucked it up and kept running anyway.
  - _speaker: 1
    _charSprite: {fileID: 0}
    _CG: {fileID: 0}
    _music: {fileID: 0}
    _shakeCamera: 0
    _triggerHeartbeat: 0
    _maxFriendship: 0
    _dialogueLine: No way in HELL was I gonna lag behind and return to that miserable
      room. That dumb, lifeless, dull room that made me wish for death every day.
  - _speaker: 1
    _charSprite: {fileID: 0}
    _CG: {fileID: 0}
    _music: {fileID: 0}
    _shakeCamera: 0
    _triggerHeartbeat: 0
    _maxFriendship: 0
    _dialogueLine: Then I just landed here. Far away enough from my home to feel
      alive.
  - _speaker: 1
    _charSprite: {fileID: 0}
    _CG: {fileID: 0}
    _music: {fileID: 0}
    _shakeCamera: 0
    _triggerHeartbeat: 0
    _maxFriendship: 0
    _dialogueLine: "I nearly pissed myself thinking about how excited I was to finally
      be a part of the world. How happy I was to finally just\u2026 exist like a
      normal fucking person, you know?"
  - _speaker: 1
    _charSprite: {fileID: 0}
    _CG: {fileID: 0}
    _music: {fileID: 0}
    _shakeCamera: 0
    _triggerHeartbeat: 0
    _maxFriendship: 0
    _dialogueLine: But turns out the outside world is also full of shit.
  - _speaker: 1
    _charSprite: {fileID: 0}
    _CG: {fileID: 0}
    _music: {fileID: 0}
    _shakeCamera: 0
    _triggerHeartbeat: 0
    _maxFriendship: 0
    _dialogueLine: Why the hell is it so hard to get along with people? They see
      you try and then they just tell you to fuck off and die?
  - _speaker: 1
    _charSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: f029f114187d16c46b68146e4a2ca0fb, type: 3}
    _CG: {fileID: 0}
    _music: {fileID: 0}
    _shakeCamera: 0
    _triggerHeartbeat: 0
    _maxFriendship: 0
    _dialogueLine: It's so, so, so unfair. I just want to be welcomed back in the
      world and everyone decides they don't want to take me in.
  - _speaker: 1
    _charSprite: {fileID: 0}
    _CG: {fileID: 0}
    _music: {fileID: 0}
    _shakeCamera: 0
    _triggerHeartbeat: 0
    _maxFriendship: 0
    _dialogueLine: What the fuck is wrong with everybody? Why are they doing this
      to me??
  - _speaker: 1
    _charSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: e5765cb552eb0e743b1d025dd7e12a90, type: 3}
    _CG: {fileID: 0}
    _music: {fileID: 0}
    _shakeCamera: 1
    _triggerHeartbeat: 0
    _maxFriendship: 0
    _dialogueLine: Why why why why why WHY???
  - _speaker: 1
    _charSprite: {fileID: 0}
    _CG: {fileID: 0}
    _music: {fileID: 0}
    _shakeCamera: 1
    _triggerHeartbeat: 0
    _maxFriendship: 0
    _dialogueLine: "I hate it. I hate it all. I hate my stupid fucking brother, my
      stupid fucking parents, and the stupid FUCKING\u2026 EVERYBODY!!!"
  - _speaker: 2
    _charSprite: {fileID: 0}
    _CG: {fileID: 0}
    _music: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 0c5382dc1be826a4581be7153a44fbd4, type: 3}
    _shakeCamera: 0
    _triggerHeartbeat: 0
    _maxFriendship: 0
    _dialogueLine: "\u2026 hah, that's quite the sob story if I've ever heard one."
  - _speaker: 2
    _charSprite: {fileID: 0}
    _CG: {fileID: 0}
    _music: {fileID: 0}
    _shakeCamera: 0
    _triggerHeartbeat: 0
    _maxFriendship: 0
    _dialogueLine: I'm impressed by how much it makes terrible, terrible sense.
  - _speaker: 2
    _charSprite: {fileID: 0}
    _CG: {fileID: 0}
    _music: {fileID: 0}
    _shakeCamera: 0
    _triggerHeartbeat: 0
    _maxFriendship: 0
    _dialogueLine: "Frankly, it's comical how on-the-nose it is. Being forced into
      isolation and unable to break out of her socially impaired nature\u2026 it
      doesn't get any better than that."
  - _speaker: 2
    _charSprite: {fileID: 0}
    _CG: {fileID: 0}
    _music: {fileID: 0}
    _shakeCamera: 0
    _triggerHeartbeat: 0
    _maxFriendship: 0
    _dialogueLine: I suppose sympathy is in order if I want to get her on my side.
  - _speaker: 0
    _charSprite: {fileID: 0}
    _CG: {fileID: 0}
    _music: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 9cfcb3fce373b5e47a01e7005bc945c3, type: 3}
    _shakeCamera: 0
    _triggerHeartbeat: 0
    _maxFriendship: 0
    _dialogueLine: "\u2026 I'm sorry you had to endure all that, Jessi."
  - _speaker: 0
    _charSprite: {fileID: 0}
    _CG: {fileID: 0}
    _music: {fileID: 0}
    _shakeCamera: 0
    _triggerHeartbeat: 0
    _maxFriendship: 0
    _dialogueLine: The world truly is an unforgiving place, isn't it?
  - _speaker: 0
    _charSprite: {fileID: 0}
    _CG: {fileID: 0}
    _music: {fileID: 0}
    _shakeCamera: 0
    _triggerHeartbeat: 0
    _maxFriendship: 0
    _dialogueLine: The lives we want to lead are often not the lives we're supposed
      to.
  - _speaker: 0
    _charSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: a7221be3902993e49920b17cf290b8cb, type: 3}
    _CG: {fileID: 0}
    _music: {fileID: 0}
    _shakeCamera: 0
    _triggerHeartbeat: 0
    _maxFriendship: 0
    _dialogueLine: Sadly, there's nothing to be done about that. You can't change
      the system.
  - _speaker: 0
    _charSprite: {fileID: 0}
    _CG: {fileID: 0}
    _music: {fileID: 0}
    _shakeCamera: 0
    _triggerHeartbeat: 0
    _maxFriendship: 0
    _dialogueLine: You can only learn how to live alongside it and follow its logic,
      whether you like it or not.
  - _speaker: 0
    _charSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 5d5bfc11db4b6324d85fdd72f11891ad, type: 3}
    _CG: {fileID: 0}
    _music: {fileID: 0}
    _shakeCamera: 0
    _triggerHeartbeat: 0
    _maxFriendship: 0
    _dialogueLine: An unfortunate truth, but nonetheless, the truth.
  - _speaker: 1
    _charSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 0cbf25f7256b5034e9498573542f4e76, type: 3}
    _CG: {fileID: 0}
    _music: {fileID: 0}
    _shakeCamera: 0
    _triggerHeartbeat: 0
    _maxFriendship: 0
    _dialogueLine: ...
  - _speaker: 2
    _charSprite: {fileID: 0}
    _CG: {fileID: 0}
    _music: {fileID: 0}
    _shakeCamera: 0
    _triggerHeartbeat: 0
    _maxFriendship: 0
    _dialogueLine: Her gaze continues to escape me. My concern quickly rises and
      dies in the same breath as she nods her head ever-so-slightly.
  - _speaker: 2
    _charSprite: {fileID: 0}
    _CG: {fileID: 0}
    _music: {fileID: 0}
    _shakeCamera: 0
    _triggerHeartbeat: 0
    _maxFriendship: 0
    _dialogueLine: The corners of her mouth quirk upwards to form a sliver of a smile.
      Perfect.
  - _speaker: 2
    _charSprite: {fileID: 0}
    _CG: {fileID: 0}
    _music: {fileID: 0}
    _shakeCamera: 0
    _triggerHeartbeat: 0
    _maxFriendship: 0
    _dialogueLine: Such satisfaction will do well for the proposition I'm about to
      suggest.
  _playerReplyOptions: []
  _npcReplies: []
  _gameEnd: 1
